                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's one of those hidden gems, you know? It's just plain good. \n\nIf you like shmups, it's an easy pick. \n\nIf you haven't played a shmup yet, it's a very good start because it has many difficulty settings and even a Practice mode for you to train bosses without the risk of running out of lives. \n\nIt features a classic arcade mode where you play 5 levels back to back (it doesn't save in between, you have to finish all 5 in the same run), it has limited lives and credits if you lose all lives. But it's also kind of a roguelike with its Labyrinth mode, which features a randomly generated campaign!\n\nI've only sank in 4 hours and can't wait to unlock more modes, characters and try everything the game has to offer.\n\nIt's such a shame this game hasn't received much attention :/",
